{"sections":[{"slug":"Kummer理论","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Kummer理论"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Kummer <span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Kummer 理论"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">单位根概形</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">为正整数</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/乘法群概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">乘法群概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbb G_m = \\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z}[x^{\\pm 1}]$. <span lang=\"zh\">记</span>\n$$\r\nn\\colon \\mathbb G_m \\to \\mathbb G_m\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">次方映射</span>,\n<span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> “$n$ <span lang=\"zh\">次单位根</span>” "},{"Local":{"url":"/群概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为其核</span>:\n$$\r\n\\mu_n := \\operatorname{ker}(n\\colon \\mathbb G_m \\to \\mathbb G_m).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">作为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/函子式代数几何","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">函子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{Ring} \\to \\mathsf{Set}$, $\\mu_n(A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">次方等于</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素的集合</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span>"}},{"Plain":", $\\mu_n = \\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z}[x]/(x^n-1)$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">基底的选取</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\zeta_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">次</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/本原单位根","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">本原单位根</span>"}},{"Plain":". Kummer <span lang=\"zh\">理论关注的是定义在</span> $A:=\\mathbb{Z}[1/n][\\zeta_n]$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的概形</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">这种概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $\\mathcal O(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有本原</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">次单位根</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">在其中可逆</span>.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/基变换","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">基变换</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上会产生如下两个重要现象</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">由于本原单位根</span> $\\zeta_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的存在</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">单位根群</span> $\\mu_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">成为</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">循环群</span></strong> $\\mathbb{Z}/n$. <span lang=\"zh\">具体地</span>, $A[x]/(x^n-1) \\simeq \\prod_{i=0}^{n-1} A[x]/(x-\\zeta_n^i) \\simeq A^n$.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">由于</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">可逆</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">概形态射</span> $n\\colon \\mathbb G_m \\to\\mathbb G_m$ <span lang=\"zh\">成为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/平展概形态射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展覆盖</span>"}},{"Plain":" ($y^n-x$ <span lang=\"zh\">关于</span> $y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的导数可逆</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">从而是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/平展景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展景</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象中的满射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">满射</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">长正合列</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $\\mathbb{Z}[1/n][\\zeta_n]$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/平展景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展景</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群短正合列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">短正合列</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n0 \\to \\mu_n \\to \\mathbb G_m \\overset{n}{\\to} \\mathbb G_m\\to 0\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">给出</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/平展上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的长正合列</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n0 &amp;\\to \\mu_n(X) \\to \\mathcal O(X)^* \\overset{n}{\\to} \\mathcal O (X)^*\\\\\r\n&amp;\\to H^1(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mu_n) \\to \\operatorname{Pic}(X) \\overset{n}{\\to} \\operatorname{Pic}(X),\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\operatorname{Pic}(X) = H^1(X,\\mathbb G_m)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Picard群","text":"Picard <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":".\n<span lang=\"zh\">这个结论也可以表述为正合列</span>\n$$\r\n0 \\to \\mathcal O(X)^* / (\\mathcal O(X)^*)^n\r\n\\to H^1(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mu_n) \\to \\operatorname{Pic}(X)_n \\to 0.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为代数闭域</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的完备光滑曲线</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Picard群","text":"Picard <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">分解为</span> $\\operatorname{Pic}^0(X)\\oplus \\mathbb{Z}$, <span lang=\"zh\">而</span> $\\operatorname{Pic}^0(X) \\simeq \\operatorname{Jac}(X)(k)\\simeq (\\mathbb{Z}/n)^{2g}$, $\\operatorname{Jac}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Jacobi簇","text":"Jacobi <span lang=\"zh\">簇</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">结论</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为代数闭域</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上亏格为</span> $g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的完备连通光滑曲线</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">正整数</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">中可逆</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span>\n$$\r\nH^1(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mu_n)\\simeq H^1(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mathbb{Z}/n)\\simeq (\\mathbb{Z}/n)^{2g}.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}